I remember that there were a few postings a while back detailing a way
that one could remove items from a shop without setting off the alarm,
whereby he could go back and resell the stuff to the shopkeeper,
eventually getting all their gold and still having the stuff as well.
An average situation:

---------
|]......| <- Me next to pile of unpaid stuff
|@......|
|.......|
|.......|
|......@+ <- Shopkeeper by door
---------

I believe the method involves digging into the wall in two places in
the corner opposite where the door is, and then kicking the objects
diagonally from one opening into another or something like that. Could
some of you avid players that know how to do this please detail this
on the net or e-mail me? The other game I took the oracle's advice and
zapped by wand of digging at the floor while loaded up with stuff;
rats, but at least I still had my rings on...

